<title>SIERRA LEONE: Measles kill 15 children in Sierra Leone.</title>
<headline>Measles kill 15 children in Sierra Leone.</headline>
<dateline>FREETOWN 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>An outbreak of measles has killed 15 children in northern Sierra Leone, state radio said on Saturday, quoting health officials.</p>
<p>The outbreak initially affected five villages in Kambia district but was showing signs of spreading, the radio added.</p>
